# FIXED-BLOCKS-AUDIT: the words of a refusal name what they refuse in full.
# A named actual of 300 bytes that names no formal of f (book :1060), after a
# named one: refused where it stands, with the whole name in the words, which
# were cut at 200 bytes before.
fn: f (int: a; int: b) int
    return: a - b
int: r 0
r: f(a: 8; : 1)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
